quad("Example 2 · k = 3: (x - 4)/(x^2 + 9)", 1, -4, 0, 9)
quad("Example 4 · complete the square: 1/(x^2 + 2x + 5)", 0, 1, 2, 5)
quad("Example 5 · x on top: (x + 3)/(x^2 + 2x + 5)", 1, 3, 2, 5)

